Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; ERP NOX - libera som e avisos do sistema neste computador (Chrome e Edge). Duplo clique, confirmar, reabrir o navegador.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Google\Chrome\AutoplayAllowlist]
"1"="https://noxperformanceeng.github.io"

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Google\Chrome\NotificationsAllowedForUrls]
"1"="https://noxperformanceeng.github.io"

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Edge\AutoplayAllowlist]
"1"="https://noxperformanceeng.github.io"

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Edge\NotificationsAllowedForUrls]
"1"="https://noxperformanceeng.github.io"
